  "id": "ultimate-explanation",
  "term": "ultimate explanation",
  "definition": "In this historical usage, ultimate explanation means the most final level to which an account can reduce what is being explained. The dispute is about what those last explanatory terms are, such as axioms, self-evident truths, regular sequences, or descriptive and analytical judgments.",
